":"grammar-choice","kind":"choice","prompt":"“将be动词提到句首构成一般疑问句，语调用升调” 描述的是哪个语法点？","hint":"Is/Are + 主语 + 动词-ing + 其他?","options":["颜色表达：It's + 颜色","None of 的用法","现在进行时的Yes/No疑问句","否定疑问句与反义疑问"],"answer":2,"explain":"现在进行时的Yes/No疑问句：Is/Are + 主语 + 动词-ing + 其他?：用于询问某人是否正在做某事","source":{"kind":"grammar","title":"现在进行时的Yes/No疑问句"},"id":"b1-u16-q04"},{"type":"translation-choice","kind":"choice","prompt":"选出下面句子的正确中文意思：\nShe's sitting under the tree.","hint":"","options":["他只有四十一岁，","我刚喝了一杯，谢谢。","你是哪国人？","她坐在树下。"],"answer":3,"explain":"She's sitting under the tree. — 她坐在树下。","source":{"kind":"sentence","en":"She's sitting under the tree."},"id":"b1-u16-q05"},{"type":"dictation","kind":"text","prompt":"听写：点击播放，写出你听到的句子。","hint":"共 4 个单词","answer":"Who's climbing the tree?","placeholder":"输入完整英文句子","explain":"Who's climbing the tree? — 谁在爬树？","playText":"Who's climbing the tree?","source":{"kind":"sentence","en":"Who's climbing the tree?"},"id":"b1-u16-q06"}],"grammar":[{"title":"现在进行时 (Present Continuous Tense)","definition":"表示正在进行的动作或发生的事，由be动词(am/is/are) + 动词-ing形式构成","structure":"主语 + am/is/are + 动词-ing + 其他","usage":"用于描述说话时正在发生的动作","examples":[{"en":"She's sitting under the tree.","zh":"她正坐在树下。"},{"en":"He's climbing the tree.","zh":"他正在爬树。"},{"en":"It's running across the grass.","zh":"它正在穿过草地跑。"}]},{"title":"现在进行时的Yes/No疑问句","definition":"将be动词提到句首构成一般疑问句，语调用升调","structure":"Is/Are + 主语 + 动词-ing + 其他?","usage":"用于询问某人是否正在做某事","examples":[{"en":"Is Tim in the garden, too?","zh":"Tim也在花园里吗？"},{"en":"Is the cat climbing the tree?","zh":"那只猫正在爬树吗？"},{"en":"What's she doing?","zh":"她正在做什么？"}]},{"title":"Where引导的特殊疑问句","definition":"用where提问地点，句式为Where + be动词 + 主语?","structure":"Where + is/are + 主语?","usage":"用于询问某人或某物在哪里","examples":[{"en":"Where's Sally, Jack?","zh":"Sally在哪里，Jack？"},{"en":"Where are the children?","zh":"孩子们在哪里？"}]}],"patterns":[{"pattern":"Where + be动词 + 主语?","explanation":"","original":{"en":"Where's Sally, Jack?","zh":"Sally在哪里，Jack？"},"examples":[{"en":"Where's Tom?","zh":"Tom在哪里？"},{"en":"Where are my keys?","zh":"我的钥匙在哪里？"}]},{"pattern":"What's + 主语 + doing?","explanation":"","original":{"en":"What's she doing?","zh":"她正在做什么？"},"examples":[{"en":"What's Tim doing?","zh":"Tim正在做什么？"},{"en":"What's the dog doing?","zh":"那只狗正在做什么？"}]},{"pattern":"Is/Are + 主语 + 动词-ing + 其他?","explanation":"","original":{"en":"Is Tim in the garden, too?","zh":"Tim也在花园里吗？"},"examples":[{"en":"Is he climbing the tree?","zh":"他正在爬树吗？"},{"en":"Are the children playing in the garden?","zh":"孩子们正在花园里玩吗？"}]},{"pattern":"What about + 名词/代词?","explanation":"","original":{"en":"What about the dog?","zh":"那只狗呢？"},"examples":[{"en":"What about your sister?","zh":"你姐姐呢？"},{"en":"What about this book?","zh":"这本书怎么样？"}]}]}
